[en.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_ACQUISITION]
Applewood Acquisition Plan

[en.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_ACQUISITION_desc]
The first step of stepping towards the world under the lead of Stella Flare, is to acquire more land: Sire’s Hollow is not a self-sufficient community. With a developed service industry but a weak agricultural foundation, Sire’s Hollow needs more land to ensure its food supply, and thus ensure its economic independence.\nApplewood is the target selected by Stella Flare after careful consideration: located at the border of Tartarus Prison, Applewood is a huge orchard (in fact it was a prosperous film and television city before the war, but was soon abandoned). It has been neglected by the Empire due to the rampant biological community of Tartarus. There are no other forces interested in Applewood, so acquiring Applewood will not cause other forces to be alert.\nBut in any case, we need a profitable deal — Stella Flare is never gonna pay too much for an abandoned orchard. Therefore, a small expression of “sincerity” to the Minister of Finance may be enough...

[zh.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_ACQUISITION]
苹果坞收购计划

[zh.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_ACQUISITION_desc]
恒星耀斑带领名流谷走向世界的第一步，便是获取更多的土地：名流谷并不是一个自给自足的社区，服务业发达而农业基础薄弱，因此名流谷需要更多的土地来确保自己的食物供应，进而保证经济上的独立。\n而苹果坞则是恒星耀斑精挑细选后的目标：位于塔尔塔洛斯监狱的边界，苹果坞是一个庞大的果树林（其实战前曾经是一个繁华的影视城，但是很快被废弃）。由于塔尔塔洛斯的生物群系泛滥，而被帝国所忽视管辖。周边也没有其他的势力对苹果坞感兴趣，因此收购苹果坞不会引起其他势力的警惕。\n但无论如何，我们需要一笔划算的交易——恒星耀斑不可能为一片废弃的果树林付出太多的代价。对财政部长转达一点点“诚意”，或许就可以了...

